  "book_id": "woman-in-the-dunes",
  "chunk_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-chunk-0256",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“办法？……还说是办法！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A way? ... You still call that a way!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他忽地来气了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He suddenly grew angry.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "先是气束缚女人的势力，进而又气被束缚的女人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "First he was angry at the forces that bound the woman, and then he was angry at the woman who let herself be bound,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "“这样辛苦，干什么非得赖在这种村子里呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If it is this hard, why insist on clinging to a village like this?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "实在想不通……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I really cannot understand it...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "沙子这东西，非同小可，所以，要是谁以为能抵抗沙子，那才叫异想天开呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Sand is no small matter, so if anyone thinks they can stand up against sand, that is sheer fantasy.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "毫无意义！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is completely meaningless!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "这种毫无意义的事，别干，别干了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do not do something so meaningless, stop it, just stop...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00256",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "完全不值得同情！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is not worth any sympathy at all!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
